  "prefLabel": "Ins 308.03 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 308.03 Scope. This rule shall apply to all domestic life and accident and health insurers and to all other licensed life and accident and health insurers that are not subject to a substantially similar regulation in their domiciliary state. This rule shall also similarly apply to licensed property and casualty insurers with respect to their accident and health business. This rule shall not apply to assumption reinsurance, yearly renewable term reinsurance or certain nonproportional reinsurance such as stop loss or catastrophe reinsurance.\n\nSource. #5480, eff 10-1-92; ss by #6522, eff 6-6-97; ss by #8239, eff 1-3-05; ss by #10196, eff 1-3-13 (from Ins 308.02); ss by #13494, eff 11-22-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins300.html"
